From: Dmitry Afonchenko <undermove1@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 18:38:52 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 206/206] Meridian: agents can choose an option in a <select>

type_text into a dropdown chooses the option it names (text or value) and sends
input/change; get_interactive_elements lists a dropdown's options and names it
by its <label>.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SwxrQ2eLfJ2bv8cCoG2va1
